# Harness workspace

- Harness root is **generic** — runtime, CLI, Hermes/Kiro bridge, `docs/kit/`.
- Product specs live under `projects/<name>/` (default: `projects/aegis-rpc/`).
- When building a product, open that project folder and read `.harness/project-context.md` + `AGENTS.md`.
